- Order: free licenses first (Wikimedia Commons — the API `prop=imageinfo&iiprop=url|extmetadata&iiurlwidth=1280`
  gives `thumburl`, `descriptionurl`, `Artist`, `LicenseShortName`), then — only in the categories
  `gate-rules.json` `images.external.quotation_categories` names — the rights holder's official pages for a quotation.
- Never: fan art, re-edits, watermarked stock, stills with burned-in subtitles, personal SNS posts,
  wiki uploads of works.
