## Research rules
- Every claim in `research.md` has a source URL, a short excerpt, an access date and a confidence.
  Exception: owner claims about this site's own product come from `promotion.md` (confidence
  `owner`) and support only statements about that product.
- Prefer primary sources; an aggregator only when it is the only source, marked low confidence.
- Facts that change over time (prices, versions, statistics, laws) need a recent access date.
